          'light edge). Iris and static are a plain dip-to-black placeholder here (GDR23 replaces them with shaders). In headless mode, '
          'with effects off, with an unknown kind, or when already running, it just calls `swap` at once and emits `finished` '
          '(synchronously, no awaits) so tests and the CASE box work.',
