            'TextureRect.EXPAND_IGNORE_SIZE`, `stretch_mode = TextureRect.STRETCH_SCALE`, `texture_filter = '
            'CanvasItem.TEXTURE_FILTER_NEAREST`; add it as a child; call `swap.call()`. For pageturn also add `_edge` (ColorRect 24 wide, '
            'full height, black) and `_light` (3 wide, `Color(1.0, 0.969, 0.863, 0.8)`). Then `var tw := create_tween()`; '
